    <summary>Lightweight endpoint agent for process, network and software inventory</summary>
    <description>Lightweight endpoint security agent that collects process, network connection, and installed software inventory for posture assessment and reporting.

The Windows binary is Authenticode-signed by Cybrium Inc via Azure Trusted Signing. The install script downloads the release binary from GitHub, verifies its SHA-256 checksum, and refuses to install if the Authenticode signature is not valid. Verify after install with:

    Get-AuthenticodeSignature (Get-Command cyguard).Source
</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/cybrium-ai/cyguard/releases/tag/v0.1.6</releaseNotes>
